{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_main_08-06_end",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "main_08-06",
  "title": "戰場，蔓延不止",
  "storyCode": "R8-6",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "../../vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_08-06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "78bfb1b41b74a5d4047aecceefac3393c674abce6cb303169d40a1743cd63490",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snow_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝您的支援，先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——塔露拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想離開雪原？你會被烏薩斯的鐵甲碾碎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸？為什麼是現在？我們不是打贏了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "盾衛已經去收集資源。你收隊。命令全部人轉移。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你和你的計畫會讓所有人都送命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "塔露拉意識到，面前的巨人是第一次對自己發表他的意見。即使這意見不可撼動，傷人入骨。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "西北凍原也不能讓我們活下去。我們的隊伍越壯大，就越需要食物與能源補給，厭惡我們的聚落遠比支持我們的村莊更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一年一季的苔麥......哪怕我們也參與耕種，那能收成多少？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的田地會不會被糾察隊毀掉？遊擊隊能夠輕鬆地戰勝他們，但其他的感染者做不到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在加速他們的死亡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們只有離開凍原。不是去薩米，也不是去荒地......我們向東方去，向南方去，向溫暖的地方去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你要怎麼樣生存下去？ 你要怎樣讓我們這麼多人生存下去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遊擊隊是在救人。遊擊隊絕不會犧牲遊擊隊之外的人。只有戰士才犧牲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然而，在各個城市和城市周邊生活的感染者，遠比在凍原上的更多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您常駐守北方，對北方感染者的遭遇深惡痛絕......所以您也不太有機會瞭解到，南方的感染者是怎樣生活的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們過得很好？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們過得很糟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想吸納他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我要團結他們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帝國看向感染者時，你首當其衝。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是團結在我身邊。不。是團結在同一個理念周圍。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "理念？感染者在凍原上被當作鋸末，在礦場裡被當作廢渣，在聚落被當作懲示，在城市被當作什麼燃料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凍原上的感染者既不無知也不愚蠢。我們不抱幻想。所有的理念在被實踐前都是幻想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凍原上還有礦場，有巡邏隊，有愚蠢懈怠的守軍。我們有地方獲得資源。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冰原上的資源遲早會被耗盡，因為我們沒有開發資源的手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們沒有可持久運作的移動城市，我們沒有稱職專業的天災信使......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走向城市，我們一無所有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們會獲得新的朋友。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "誰是你的朋友？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以承認你的計畫有過人之處。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然而，你所圖謀的，即使有可取之處也不出奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有多少戰略家在凍原上潦倒而死？你所說的這些，我看不出你為何能做到，靠什麼去實現。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼先皇能讓大地顫抖？因為他執著於此，且從不談論遠大願景。他只邁步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而你不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "先生！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你說我會被烏薩斯的鐵甲碾碎，我承認，他們遲早會看向我們這裡。我們總有一天會被抓到。我們都逃不過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“讓他們來”？您會這樣想嗎，先生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凍原會讓您更好地準備一場決戰嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在尋找一個新的戰場？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我在找尋一個勝機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對於更多感染者來說那是希望。但對於你我這種戰士，那是一個契機。擺脫我們固有戰略的唯一契機。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在凍原上的輾轉到頭來也只是慢性死亡......就像我們身為感染者剩下的那點生命一樣。我要不斷重複這一點，因為你我都清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我女兒也許會相信你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我不相信一個從沒因事實而失望，一直只是在陳托某種不切實際的學說的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔露拉？你去哪裡？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒事的。只是去檢查礦場有沒有生還者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "遊擊隊已經帶隊出發，聚落也開始轉移了。烏薩斯的軍隊也沒有繼續追蹤我們的跡象......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "霜星",
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "爸？你怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "愛國者",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_025_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是普通的咳嗽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "窸窣聲"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這裡有人嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道你們在這。你們不是烏薩斯軍人，你們連樹枝都沒踩斷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒有惡意。如果你們不是感染者，我也就此離開，除非你們需要幫助......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，不准再靠近！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別動！否則我就放箭了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怯生生的孩子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她，她是感染者！薩沙，我的法術能把感染者趕走的......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可以用法術！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怯生生的孩子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩沙......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你，你快點走開！我們只是從礦場裡拿了些東西......我們不想殺人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我會放箭的！你會死！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怯生生的孩子",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "薩沙......可是，可你說......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們有幾天沒吃飯了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_085",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不關你的事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在軍駐礦場附近，你們也不敢生火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你們抖得就像篩穀時的小麥。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怯生生的孩子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_084",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗚......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_085",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘁。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不要怕。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "塔露拉用手抓住了一根樹枝。\n她輕輕將樹枝遞向兩個孩子，樹枝由內而外飄出火星。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "怯生生的孩子",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_084",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "薩沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_085",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "暖和些了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對，我的確是感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutry_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "原來是這樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就是這樣找到薩沙和伊諾......他們一直不願意和別人說之前的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我們沒發現他們，他們肯定活不下去的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "也許在愛國者否定我之後，只有這件事算是好事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那今天這個是怎麼回事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......訓練裡我的法術不小心波及了霜星掛在旁邊的斗篷。她要和我拼命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就答應她一定幫她縫好了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "事實上，阿麗娜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了吧。給我吧，你對針線怕是一竅不通。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不想加入我們的隊伍嗎？也許加上你的伶牙俐齒，我說服愛國者的可能性更大些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說過了，塔露拉......我說過的。我的法術對遊擊隊沒用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我可以沾上血，但我不想主動去傷害人。你以後可不單是會面對感染者糾察隊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我當時拉著你一起走......也許太難為你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，你故意這麼說的，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有，我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你可別搞錯了，是我要跟著你走的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走到現在，只有一個原因，是因為......塔露拉，我覺得你很可能會忘記。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忘記什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "忘記自己到底要做什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我一直在為了感染者的未來而努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你最開始不是這麼說的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔露拉，我們都知道人是會變的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是我們把自己堅持的東西都一點一點拋乾淨，或者換成新的東西的話，那是不是到某個時候，我們就其實沒再堅持什麼了呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "在不斷的戰鬥和這些事情的變化裡，我肯定要改變方針的。僵化的思維會讓我們變得脆弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可你頑固的部分在哪呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是想證明，感染者和普通人一樣，還是想證明，普通人和感染者一樣呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有什麼區別？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果只有感染者，誰是普通人？我們是要讓所有人都染上礦石病，還是讓我們和普通人徹底隔絕呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而如果只有普通人，沒有感染者......感染了礦石病的是普通人，沒有感染的也是普通人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "神民是普通人，先民是普通人，同鄉那樣的農民是普通人，城裡居住的人，也該是普通人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔露拉，你想回到家人身邊嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的家人就是你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎。不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果去掉我們身上的礦石病......我們就能回家了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我和你一樣，也認為不能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "凍原和我們的生活徹底改變了我們。感染者已經無法重回他們過去的生活了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_snowconutryinside"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔露拉，你現在還會因為自己是感染者而感到驕傲嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼這麼問？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為不用法杖就能施術？因為我們的生命是這樣短暫？因為我們即使遭遇這麼多困難，依然也會堅持活下去？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔露拉，你會選哪個理由？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我沒必要選，阿麗娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "作為一個感染者，我就是驕傲的。因為這片大地還沒殺得了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "順帶一提，我們要追求公平也不需要什麼原因。因為我們本來就該追求公平。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果這片大地不肯給，那我們就從它那拿回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你是真的很勇敢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你沒在笑我吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有，怎麼會。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，那......我覺得，是所有肯和這個強加在我們身上的命運鬥爭下去的人，都很勇敢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你一定覺得——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "覺得什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們的命運很爛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那當然。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不這麼覺得，塔露拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你又在說反話了，阿麗娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......我是說，我能坐在這裡，能和你聊天，知道聚落外面有我們的戰士正在守候，命運待我已經很好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可別這麼說。命運是善妒的。你那麼說，它說不定就把你說的這些都拿走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我是不相信命運的，塔露拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為你能改變它？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我看不見它。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔露拉，看得見摸得著的事情是可靠的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能看見自己手中的這件斗篷。我能看見燭光，能看見自己手中的針線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能看見感染者孩子們的笑臉，我能看見烤得噴香的蔬菜上飄散出去的白色熱氣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能看得見雪花，看得見夜空中兩個月亮輕快的舞步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而有的人連這些也看不見。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔露拉，如果有一天我們都離開了你，你還能戰鬥下去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是什麼話？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總會發生的。到那時候，你還會覺得所謂的命運值得你去抗爭嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你會不會想，這太爛了，我已經什麼都做不了了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果愛國者教會了我什麼，那只有一點我覺得我已經學會了，而且早就學會了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不會低頭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它嘲諷我，那我肯定會把它燒成灰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好傻哦，塔露拉。除非你是個老頭子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老頭子說這種話才不會顯得傻。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為到了很老很老的時候如果還堅持這樣想，那就說明他遭遇太多太多了，大地在他身上留下的糟糕痕跡已經不允許他安然度過自己的生活。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那樣的他是活在過去的沙漠中的。如果是我，我甚至沒勇氣邁出第一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是我那麼老又那麼傲氣，那我走的每一步就都是拿過去的所有事情來戳自己。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我甚至想像不出，在那個記憶和過去的沙漠裡，人要怎麼樣才能保證自己還在往前走？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "又要是怎麼樣強韌的精神，才能讓他們邁出新的一步，不同於過往的更新的一步？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總覺得你是在暗指誰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說了，我知道不少他的事，但我確實不認識愛國者老先生。我一句話也沒和他說過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你如果說是他的話，哎，那就是他吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "假如愛國者老先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "代入得還挺快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和他們這些年老的戰士不一樣，年輕人卻是會遺忘，會放棄，會寬恕自己的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，你覺得我只是在為了看得見的一切而戰？或者說，這難道不對？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和你在我們離開村子那時候對我說的句子相比，太淺了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這麼幾年過來，你已經成了一個優秀的領袖。但這對你也不全是好事，你也不能讓自己停在這裡吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“如果公義需要更多暴力才能伸張，那還能叫公義嗎？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這句話已經困擾我許多年了，這麼多年來我一直在想這件事。我可能沒想通，但我可是一直在想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那好，把剛才我們說的命運啊抗爭啊這些詞全丟掉。阿麗娜老師，今天你想教我們些什麼呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿。你是不是對霜星也那麼油腔滑調的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可別瞎說。霜星會把你我的嘴巴都凍上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是你的話，塔露拉，你不會只是為了戰勝看得見的敵人去戰鬥的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糾察隊，礦場的監工，追蹤著我們的徵召兵，烏薩斯醫學大臣......戰勝那些，我們就勝利了嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為這些東西很壞，所以我們要戰勝它？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿麗娜老師是希望我和看不見的東西戰鬥。我要怎麼戰勝它們呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "和你能許諾的東西，溫暖、食物、床被，與這些總有一天能摸得著的東西不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這場仗我們大概不會有結果，我們可能沒辦法贏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經不太想許諾了。太遠的事情無異於欺騙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "永遠不會贏，那還要打嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不是問過嗎？到那時候，你還覺得這個命運是值得你去抗爭的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些都過去以後，你甚至連敵人都看不見了。你和那些看不見未來的人有同樣的敵人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那時，真正的戰鬥才剛剛開始呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是在說那些精神，那些敵意，還有那些刻在烏薩斯人與我們骨子裡的東西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——皇帝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "皇帝也只是它的一種樣子吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只要人們還不肯放下刀，那這場戰爭就不會結束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不同意。人們拿起刀去對抗那些傾軋他們的東西是正義的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯。其實我認為這場戰爭，就是不會結束的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "萊塔尼亞和維多利亞的書，托愛國者先生的福，我也看了不少。我很喜歡有些人說的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“我們的戰爭是一場針對自我的戰爭。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，塔露拉，因為你們不會放下手中的刀劍——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......所以你也不會放下手中的針線。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "本節課到此結束！已經沒什麼好教你的了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "孩子們現在就該讀書。有的知識他們明天就該知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "塔露拉......科西切要你是聖人，可人都會犯錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "摔倒以後要爬起來。但如果他不允許你摔倒......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你就只能小心翼翼一點。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "面對愛國者也是一樣的，我其實不把他和你當成兩種人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你們都已經太相信自己的想法了，我卻不能讓那些活潑的小生命現在就說，你是對的他是錯的這類的話。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，阿麗娜。我不能去做我自己都不相信的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是的，這也是科西切使喚的伎倆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這不就是在說我不可能消滅他？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那是一種思想。我們可能是沒辦法消滅一種思想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我還是有點自信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼自信？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果我們那時候都還在你身邊的話，我們一定能把你拉回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不管科西切的法術是什麼樣的東西，我們也一定有辦法破得掉。我們總能做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這場戰爭，我們從文字和語言開始，從下一刻開始，從一個表情開始。從現在開始。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他們會知道哪種蘑菇可以吃，該怎麼養家畜，如果感冒的話要怎麼才能早點好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們會試著不輸掉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果是你也一定有機會說服愛國者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這句我就勉強當是鼓勵了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喏，縫好了。給她吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看得出她很愛惜這件斗篷。像是軍隊出產的。而且，裡三層外三層，看著很大。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能是軍隊的斗篷。也許是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......愛國者先生能繼續戰鬥下去的那些原因，我們說不定找到了其中一個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "謝謝你，阿麗娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼？我要準備明天的課了。這可是繪畫課，他們都等著呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "下次再幫你弄兩把筆刷回來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是說，我想說......我是想問，你真的......不想和霜星他們認識嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戰士們都知道我們有好幾個感染者老師，只不過你把自己藏得嚴嚴實實的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是現在，塔露拉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "等你說的那個感染者共同的理想實現的時候，我和他們自然會認識的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿麗娜",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_079",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再說，我們可都是戰士，只是戰場不同。我們遲早會相互認識的，是不是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "塔露拉",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_078",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒錯，阿麗娜。感染者戰士阿麗娜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": [
    {
      "speakerId": "char_1505_frstar",
      "aliases": [
        "霜星"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
